	And I click on the "Contacts" tab
	And I click on the contact link for the contact with the email address "usr.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	Then I should be able to view the following user values in the user details page
	| Name               | USR Koroneiki1                       |
	| Email Address      | usr.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Number of Accounts | 1                                    |
