	And the save button on the assign contact form should be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Unassign Role | Support Watcher |
	Then I should be able to view the error message for overlapping roles
	And the save button on the assign contact form should be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Unassign Role | Administrator |
	Then I should not be able to view an error message
	And the save button on the assign contact form should not be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Unassign Role | Support Developer |
	Then I should not be able to view an error message
	And the save button on the assign contact form should be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Assign Role | Support Developer |
	Then I should not be able to view an error message
	And the save button on the assign contact form should not be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Assign Role | Administrator |
	Then I should be able to view the error message for overlapping roles
	And the save button on the assign contact form should be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Unassign Role | Administrator   |
	| Assign Role   | Support Watcher |
	Then I should be able to view the error message for overlapping roles
	And the save button on the assign contact form should be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Unassign Role | Support Developer |
	| Assign Role   | Administrator     |
	Then I should be able to view the error message for overlapping roles
	And the save button on the assign contact form should be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Unassign Role | Support Watcher |
	Then I should not be able to view an error message
	And the save button on the assign contact form should not be disabled
	When I populate the assign contact form with the following values
	| Unassign Role | Administrator   |
	| Assign Role   | Support Watcher |
	Then I should not be able to view an error message
	And the save button on the assign contact form should not be disabled
	When I click on the cancel button in the contact form
	Then I should not be able to view the contact with the email address "usr.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken"

